Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: gamma_naming_pass (validates ADR 0012)
Purpose:
    Run γ's naming-pass driver on the canonical ADR 0007 mixed graph
    across four scenarios: default policy, idempotent second call,
    tighter policy (min_instances=2), permissive policy (min_edges=1).
    Confirm relevance filter and dedup both work as specified.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0012 (NamingPolicy, NamingDecision, SkipReason,
    RSet::consider_naming, RSet::run_naming_pass, dedup via
    filter_known_instances).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0012.
    Runner: v2/examples/gamma_naming_pass.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example gamma_naming_pass

